      "writtenOn": "2025-06-10T14:59:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah true. Practically the chances are close to nil as this is early in the boot and we should have enough memory. I have wrapped it in BUG_ON() and added a comment block. I could also have a bool field in the vcpu structure instead of dynamically doing it with cpumask. What do you think?",
