        "id": 2022314
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-11T17:58:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t suggest to proceed to deprivileging, I suggested to immediately return with -ENOMEM if zalloc_cpumask_var() fails. We check pkvm_host_deprivilege_cpus() return value anyway, this would be just one of dozens of possible failures of pKVM initialization that we need to handle anyway.\n\nAnyway, if there is a simple clean way to avoid allocation, I\u0027m surely ok with that.",
      "parentUuid": "28d2051c_611d7cd3",
      "revId": "ae479e682800fab32dd07ee51ebbd0aebcfd98cc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
